### Bullet summary

- v1 adapter (ps inference) preservation ratio across the 4 compressors: avg = 1.108; 4/4 cells have ratio ≥ 1.0 (adapter answers correctly at-least-as-often as base on CONFIDENT-gold). Per-cell: KVzip val=1.15, ExpAttn val=1.23, SnapKV-ctx val=1.04, SnapKV-nat val=1.01
- mixture-cc under cc inference (KVzip val): aggregate preservation ratio = 0.511 (adapter 24/97 vs base-ps 47/97). At r=0.80: 0.611 (adapter 22/69 vs base-ps 36/69).
- Cells with preservation ratio < 0.8 (substantial sacrifice of correct answers):
    Aggregate: mixture-ps cc, KVzip val → 0.532
    Aggregate: mixture-ps cc, SnapKV-ctx val → 0.229
    Aggregate: mixture-cc cc, KVzip val → 0.511
    r=0.80:    mixture-ps cc, KVzip val → 0.556
    r=0.80:    mixture-ps cc, SnapKV-ctx val → 0.281
    r=0.80:    mixture-cc cc, KVzip val → 0.611
